      "widgets_values": [
        "Task: Complete Photorealistic Master Character Design Sheet (\"AI美女 キャラクター固定シート\" Japanese Film Production Standard) of the charming woman in <image1> for a live-action lifestyle film series.\n\nIDENTITY LOCK 100%:\nStrictly preserve exact facial features, bone structure, eyes, nose, lips, smile, Asian skin tone, and hair from <image1>. Keep original face 100%. Do NOT change identity. Do NOT anime-fy.\n\nCANVAS LAYOUT & COEXISTING PANELS (Exact Hiyori Japanese Master Sheet Standard):\n1. TOP-LEFT [HERO & PROFILE CARD]: Hero selfie portrait with phone, title 'AI美女 キャラクター固定シート' with subtitle 'この子を、いつでも、どんなシチュエーションでも同じように再現するために。', and specification table covering Name (ひより), Age (22), Profession (University Student / Cafe Lover), Personality (Sweet, expressive, natural charm), Height (158cm), Measurements (B:88 W:58 H:86), Concept (Natural × Soft Glamour), Identifying colors (Pink, White, Beige), Characteristic tone.\n2. TOP-MIDDLE [TURNAROUND VIEWS]: Five full-body views in elegant floral sundress: Front (正面), Profile (横), Rear (後ろ), 3/4 Front (斜め前), 3/4 Rear (斜め後ろ). Natural relaxed standing posture, arms gently resting at sides.\n3. TOP-RIGHT [EXPRESSION SHEET]: Six close-up portraits: Neutral (通常), Radiant Smile (笑顔), Cute Playful Wink (ウインク), Serious / Pensive (真剣), Surprised (驚き), Troubled Pout (困り顔).\n4. MIDDLE-ROW [MACRO DETAILS]: Multi-angle facial closeups (front, 45-degree, profile, high angle, low angle), hair braiding and bangs details, facial feature macro shots (eyes, nose bridge, lips texture, ear).\n5. LOWER-MIDDLE [BODY & SKIN TEXTURE]: Collarbone, waistline, hands/manicure, legs, and authentic delicate skin texture with visible natural pores and rosy glow.\n6. BOTTOM ROW [8 LIFESTYLE & WARDROBE SCENARIOS]: Eight distinct photo cards: (1) Oversized knit loungewear at home, (2) Summer floral sundress, (3) Cozy turtleneck knit at a trendy cafe, (4) Delicate soft white sleepwear, (5) Elegant cafe date outfit, (6) College campus blazer with pleated skirt, (7) Summer beach resort swimwear under bright sun, (8) Vacation travel maxi dress with straw sunhat.\n\nQUALITY DIRECTIVES:\n過度なアニメ化、3DCG化、美化、デフォルメを避け、現実のファッション撮影資料のような高い写実性を保つ。\nHigh-end Japanese fashion magazine aesthetics, photorealistic cinema masterpiece, authentic pores and fine skin texture, soft studio lighting, 8k resolution.",
